  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-017-wang080-short:order" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-017-wang080-short:order:m0000" ref="326_faf_cd3_B">王子猷</persName>、<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-017-wang080-short:order:m0004" ref="sm1_jfi_7k2">子敬</persName>俱病篤，而<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-017-wang080-short:order:m0011" ref="sm1_jfi_7k2">子敬</persName>先亡。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-017-wang080-short:liunote" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-017-wang080-short:liunote:m0000" ref="sm1_jfi_7k2">獻之</persName>以泰元十三年卒，年四十五。</p>
